  <item>
    <title>21. 雨林中消逝的芳华</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/672a45ddb2eb246ec4f050d6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">672a45ddb2eb246ec4f050d6</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 05 Nov 2024 20:15:48 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>1974年，云南边陲一个看似平常的雨夜，一位名叫朱梅华的女知青，在去往厕所的路上离奇失踪。这个案件，如同雨夜的迷雾，笼罩着人们的心头，也成为几代人心中挥之不去的谜团。</span></p><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="141">00:02:21</a>:上海毕业生的西南之旅</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="565">00:09:25</a>:上海女知青朱梅华的神秘失踪</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="753">00:12:33</a>:上海女知青神秘失踪引发的联合调查</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="941">00:15:41</a>:军犬搜索、家庭调查与嫌疑人审查</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1131">00:18:51</a>:案发当晚，祝为民与朱梅花之间的纠葛</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1509">00:25:09</a>:知青心中的阴影与不安全感</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2071">00:34:31</a>:朱梅华的失踪与知青岁月的怀念</span></p><p><span>-------------------------------</span></p><p><span>本期图片：</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrOGIsEjIMrVyRZGg8zw9E6CKgEP.png"></figure><p><span>朱梅华</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn2pqr8yZFuY1OXwvXxh1ugzf9dn.png"></figure><p><span>七营三连平面图</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgmhmR8GM0V59zbQoRW4Hz6oXQ6t.png"></figure><p><span>七营三连原厕所位置</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrI-HkUB0qHcjpB78uMK7SosmY1i.png"></figure><p><span>厕所边通往八营十三连的小路</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FstAGNYHMZSFbk75wrvXjksorLsF.png"></figure><p><span>七营三连北面1.5公里处的红堡水库</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmbXfqmvMGAAf3vuO_bDQX8M4PDs.png"></figure><p><span>农场里的龙泉公墓</span></p><p><span>-------------------------------</span></p><p><span>参考资料：</span></p><p><span>上海女知青热带雨林失踪记——上海电视台纪实频道&nbsp;</span></p>]]></description>
