  <item>
    <title>20. “爸爸，我回不来了”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6718e824db2cf82757693d24</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6718e824db2cf82757693d24</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 23 Oct 2024 12:12:20 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>2019年夏天，杭州市淳安县青溪村的千岛湖畔，一个普通的农家，收留了一对普通的游客。看似不起眼的房东与租客的相识，却引发了一桩后果极其恶劣的案件。犯人的犯罪动机到死都没有交代。不过，仔细回顾这起案件的细节，可以看出犯罪者虽然是蓄谋已久，但受害者却是被随机选择的。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="135">00:02:15</a>:朋友圈晒车配文，夫妻立有钱人设</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="258">00:04:18</a>:融洽的夫妻关系与神秘的背景</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="574">00:09:34</a>:暑假之旅：爷爷奶奶的担忧与梁谢二人的阴谋</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="767">00:12:47</a>:离奇的失踪事件：章子欣的暑假之旅引发全家人的恐慌</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1153">00:19:13</a>:两个租客带着女童离奇失踪</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1344">00:22:24</a>:东南沿海的诡异行踪</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期图片：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoZK_KFfQSsX8BaxyySSmWx1LWw6.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>梁邓华、谢艳芳来到青溪村后入住的酒店</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqJcPxTzjr65lMeIfn1mBjy-7yYM.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>梁邓华、谢艳芳</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FjmrKQXGmyJyVQuQHv8oIuuopfcH.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>子欣的奖状</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkoGJx6syLgYDs82Ycaeu85HReii.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>子欣和她的小狗</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhD_o0W6tzklnEe8nFf18NZbz-J5.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>梁、谢二人送给子欣的玩具</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgCWpILXC5nnVNQczRflRGX8kGb3.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>子欣和爸爸</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqxhaJOxIeWB93DU_aqKHlHYmv2b.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>章军和梁邓华的聊天记录</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FomyuXUOrErDHGo7-YMqfR1Pyzk0.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>当时全网转发的寻人启事</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj4_P2jLE6oAodyt7FsKIG2RFs3k.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>子欣长大想当一个画家</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvDwrx5Rm3nk69orHGAeoq5iSNlH.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>网友扒出的梁邓华的QQ号</span></p><span></span><p><span>-------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>参考资料：</span></p><span></span><p><span>百度百科：7·4淳安女童失联事件</span></p><span></span><p><span>澎湃新闻：《噩耗！遗体确认系章子欣！最后一通电话：爸爸，我回不来了》</span></p><span></span><p><span>BGM：Le Tunnel - Sylvain Chauveau</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/ll1yfAZXergj8LPbC3K4-iARS_CJ.m4a" length="55988315" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:38:34</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsbT6AVo4UXN_5m5cz8M2NGmDmk_.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>20</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>19. 当我的丈夫因谋杀我妈妈而入狱</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/670d1dd90d2f24f2890f4805</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">670d1dd90d2f24f2890f4805</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 14 Oct 2024 13:34:15 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>美国家庭邻里间的一次求助，却牵出了一桩惊天血案——6岁女孩布鲁克满身是血地敲开邻居家门，却被冷漠对待45分钟。她的外婆被奸杀，她指认大姨夫为凶手，但DNA结果却表明另有隐情。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="121">00:02:01</a>:六岁女孩遭遇强奸与袭击，凶手竟然是家人！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="365">00:06:05</a>:克拉伦斯的审判与梅琳达的坚持</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="612">00:10:12</a>:真相的追寻：一个坚强妻子的不屈不挠努力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="733">00:12:13</a>:DNA证据揭示真相：克拉伦斯并非凶手</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="857">00:14:17</a>:DNA样本的谜团：追凶三年，梅琳达与嫌疑人展开对决！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="978">00:16:18</a>:新证据出现：克拉伦斯案的证人证言发生了变化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1098">00:18:18</a>:隐藏的真相：隔壁的杀人凶手曝光，正义最终得以实现！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1233">00:20:33</a>:厄尔曼恩的DNA揭秘</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1371">00:22:51</a>:真相的追寻：七年半的坚持与努力让克拉伦斯重获自由</span></p><span></span><p><span>-------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期图片：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrEFiKgCyeHeXTT0-byR1-n-nahg.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>梅琳达和妈妈朱迪</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fudol9sY5PX6fOlU_76tEryIik-q.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>梅琳达·道森</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh94O8SKWepfMST3bYg945zdKnJ1.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>6岁的布鲁克</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtgbwVoVcvQhOnwkfpKIs8sFStWS.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>长大后的布鲁克与重获自由的姨夫</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtMKqq3Uv1wP_crmwq84AFrCa9KR.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>梅琳达的邻居托尼亚·布蕾西</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgNLCQlG7LxWqjtamhupronY1v_W.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>厄尔·曼恩</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqMzIBGD0tyYzXrRr7xje3lMk5tb.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>开始新生活的埃尔金斯</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlkpHB3wu6JkcRDaOVAkk5OdmIsi.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>2005 年 12 月 15 日，42 岁的克拉伦斯·埃尔金斯在曼斯菲尔德监狱外拥抱他的妻子梅琳达</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpZFAEYg2xBaXydhtCLYr7Qq0_CF.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>2005 年 12 月 15 日，42 岁的克拉伦斯·埃尔金斯在获释后，在曼斯菲尔德监狱外拥抱他的儿子小克拉伦斯和布兰登</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsaZixvlegeWnoj14WhdM5lQucVG.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>萨米特郡检察官雪莉·贝文·沃尔什，她在今年，也就是2024年2月退休</span></p><span></span><p><span>-------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：</span></p><span></span><p><span>No Surprises—Radiohead</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lumhftG2IWoM5VT8enhtmB5KmZKh.m4a" length="42762423" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:29:16</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fg5eAC0WcRUQsALuWxaycrCf0hry.png"/>
