  <item>
    <title>18. 厅长，杀了厅长...</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6703c7ea6c7f817786495c77</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6703c7ea6c7f817786495c77</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 07 Oct 2024 11:37:13 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>1994年10月21日下午5点40分左右，山东省农村经济开发中心总经理王家斌像平时一样回到家中。这位57岁的正厅级干部怎么也没有想到，此时杀身之祸正一步步向他逼近。</span></p><span></span><p><span>时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="121">00:02:01</a>:王家斌夫妇惨案：凶手的恶意袭击与受害者的人际关系</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="241">00:04:01</a>:政治腐败背后的血腥真相：王家斌惨遭灭门，张程震成为焦点！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="362">00:06:02</a>:枪杀厅级干部夫妇，山东命案背后隐藏的黑暗势力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="484">00:08:04</a>:山东警方探寻枪杀厅级干部夫妇的真相：案件背后隐藏的黑暗势力</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="605">00:10:05</a>:涉黑犯罪大揭秘：张昌文的黑暗过去与警察的惊人对决</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="726">00:12:06</a>:山东疑案再现！张昌文被捕，牵扯多起血腥事件！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1302">00:21:42</a>:经济开发中心背后的暗斗与恩怨！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1443">00:24:03</a>:凶杀案的背后故事</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1588">00:26:28</a>:杀人的代价：张昌文被判处死刑，剥夺政治权利终身</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期图片：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FndoD6BROojZYPvI-HdC6QUwZymQ.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>王家斌在家中</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmDsml57RQ7O1KLxyHdOYzxIMxnn.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>王家斌妻子冯淑琴</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fo5WCAtjsu3kZkWJy1hYNKbsXLMd.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>曾经的聊城市委书记张程震，拍摄于1984年</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fk7Wjx9SVcbR0rHVccaKghOHMjbX.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>张程震生平书籍中的照片</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvPy_XSQ1xF5OlptByfmcqhG6Pu3.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>勃朗宁手枪</span></p><span></span><p><span>-------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Clint Eastwood -Gorillaz</span></p><span></span><p><span>参考资料：</span></p><span></span><p><span>中国新闻网：《山东审结一起厅级干部雇凶杀人案 枪手获死刑》</span></p>]]></description>
