  <item>
    <title>16. 消失的妈妈</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66f025ca6920a36bfcda31fe</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66f025ca6920a36bfcda31fe</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 22 Sep 2024 14:12:25 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>1988年10月，一个神情慌张的妇人拿着一个录音机走进了台湾省台北市古亭警局的大厅，大喊着自己要报案。</span></p><span></span><p><span>妇人陈桂梅说，自己24岁的女儿吴瑞云，以前每两三天就要回娘家吃一次饭，但现在，她已经两个多月没见到人了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>吴瑞云失踪的蹊跷，从丈夫回来开始。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期图片：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fm9bfjghGt7tcthUSx78H4nP27ZI.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>吴瑞云</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fl001xBUFYUi8MrKuDqhYaEJkpMR.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>吴瑞云和姚正源的结婚照</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkW40_lIdOr1-ragDkTlzeZa43dl.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>吴瑞云的灵堂</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fj4FDbUEQzD4zgYZxoCSVnbBGGRp.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>警方挖掘白骨</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlSE5UWhcquw1tslajy8Y8aXGm2c.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>台湾报纸上刊登的吴瑞云案</span></p><span></span><p><span>-------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>参考资料：</span></p><span></span><p><span>网易：《台北杀妻案：“爸爸带我们去公园里埋妈妈”》</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：</span></p><span></span><p><span>妹妹背着洋娃娃——洛天依</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lsHR1n09INb1BVtVNgurMM5tY-W0.m4a" length="47698828" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:33:39</itunes:duration>
