  <item>
    <title>15. 陕西奇案：难道是分身杀人？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66eab4ac3a5ff0a0ca3ea7a0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66eab4ac3a5ff0a0ca3ea7a0</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 18 Sep 2024 11:08:28 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>陕西定边县是西北边陲的一个小县城，2005年的冬天，在这个县城里发生了一起盗窃案件，案子并不大，只丢失了几千块钱的东西，但是奇怪的是，随着这起盗窃案，一个年轻的女孩儿也神秘地失踪了。</span></p><span></span><p><span>六年的时间，这起神秘的盗窃案件连同这个神秘失踪的姑娘，一直是当地人心目中的一个谜团。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期图片：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi2TLWvGJvWp8VQsRfUDt1TL7AWa.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>乔丽</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnURf8J6JMPmo1o2FumMixgkMzjc.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>案发地的院墙高达两米</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fn0U3_ECdh1Lxz8mOfQK4bP7SFGA.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>案发小区的唯一出口</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs_ruxMk_MHNjWRxLTrGwFLvB3rn.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>楼门口放着的万红家的凳子</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fppt7TlMo15MvM2dSGrI_Y7rjZAm.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>乔丽的父亲</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FoV6oFkiwby5uo8iruvJL9Ppk06V.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>乔丽的叔叔</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgSlCLUwRLMlgc885U818nMyfpoj.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>万红家中只剩一个旅行箱</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fq6jtn6JCjwED3n5Ob96sPWlPY5v.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>卫生间墙角的血迹</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtNFdyZCKeb08UZyUyi2Y9JtHH3r.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>案发现场磁砖逢中的血迹</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fhk9HrK2Kf05Pz5hwyCOwKo2jz6H.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>带豁口的菜刀</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Ft5MSvZ1MirN9llBoHezhME3PD9r.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>权威、权超两兄弟</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpQZuMCl0OMok_Xg4zT5-EGjpr9B.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>“权威”2005年8月因犯强奸罪被判刑的判决书</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fh3QaE1RNTkimxqwAWe7OiVyLnM_.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>“权超”2007年因盗窃罪被判刑的判决书</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fgr8eIt4KXhUKYyWdL2eZIAJSrUw.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>承认罪行的权威</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FhuC_IhuZL2vK7ZjEMFJEOFDUoOs.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>权威抛尸的废井</span></p><span></span><p><span>-------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>参考资料：</span></p><span></span><p><span>今日说法：《带豁口的菜刀》</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：</span></p><span></span><p><span>Feel Good Inc.——Gorillaz</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lu-2Zpx1QiHu_6jN9s6MNsl7TaUH.m4a" length="53370187" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:36:54</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FglCptL8yJFuNrrcCH0gbv5Il2pW.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>15</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
