  <item>
    <title>14. 从警察到罪犯，从罪犯到警察</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66e1957cee04007d88d71aa7</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66e1957cee04007d88d71aa7</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 11 Sep 2024 13:04:59 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>每当有重大案件的涉案人员沉冤得雪时，总能在社会上引发轩然大波，杜培武案也是如此。18年前，云南省昆明市公安局戒毒所民警杜培武，因故意杀人罪于1999年2月5日被昆明市中级人民法院一审判处死刑，剥夺政治权力终身。两年后，因真凶被抓获，案件水落石出，蒙冤受屈26个月的杜培武被无罪释放。本期讲述的，就是杜培武从警察到罪犯，又从罪犯到警察的经历。</span></p><p><span>本期图片：</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp40KzAf4WzHN0Z6RCrqqBba_QwS.png"></figure><p><span>出狱后住院治疗的杜培武</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fp0IWnhx6BGtwvRAllldHRQDpmfS.png"></figure><p><span>穿警服的杜培武</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flb3naMFq-qG1UR3tz9gLZz-eSJz.png"></figure><p><span>杨天勇</span></p><p><span>------------------------------参考资料：</span></p><p><span>南方周末：《司法腐败酿奇冤 民警杜培武狱中遗书字字带血</span><strong><span>》</span></strong></p><p><span>中国新闻网：《传媒焦点:"杜培武案"警察对警察的刑讯逼供》</span></p><p><span>-------------------------------</span></p><p><span>片尾曲：</span></p><p><span>Extreme Ways——Moby</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lgcBMYc2jgjgJ5ccwYt-0Q-AtrLK.m4a" length="62289743" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:43:07</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsBvPvlUgLemdaHKtH35NA1H9Oii.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>14</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>13. 神秘的马路凶案</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66dc36a3ee04007d88d03326</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66dc36a3ee04007d88d03326</guid>
    <pubDate>Sat, 07 Sep 2024 11:18:58 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>33岁的刘某从山西到呼和浩特做卖水果的小生意，2015年10月8日，刘某准备去进水果，却因超车的小事和王某引发口角。刘某本想下车教训对方，可对方也并不示弱。争执中，刘某挥刀刺中了王某，连捅数刀导致王某死亡。</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期图片：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FviHUYFv894BCI4YGmm8CYgARM4l.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>案发路口</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqsBRRhiKL9yHlApUm2oivjXJX2U.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>案发现场的血迹</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuJtCIYUkEEJ7gOTw6iXzMUgcClI.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>弯折的凶器</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs2g48t45uhG5u2DyoWbCf_eV300.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>受害人的拉沙车</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsWfqObUT1t3RwXeJr08snMIDcU4.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>受害人的工友黄大哥</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Flhmgn-xHIlukbshX8Adv7s7aICo.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>嫌疑人刘某</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fi-q13BXsAJw7f89PRXujmtkEJuc.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>刘某的电动三轮车</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkRm4hs6UKnC2FtfGiodlZ8JIRPE.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>刘某电动三轮车上的受害人血迹</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpstILnMO-i7PyhnFZB6t9pcciQ-.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>刘某的老乡李峰</span></p><span></span><p><span>--------------------------------------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>参考资料：</span></p><span></span><p><span>CCTV12《夜线》：路怒十七刀</span></p><span></span><p><span>片尾曲：</span></p><span></span><p><span>UNDER PRESSURE——Queen / David Bowie</span></p><span></span><p><span>欢迎大家关注小赵探案公众号：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrZF-kCz47E74-lwdemfirsoQEPb.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span>欢迎添加小赵个人微信，加入听友群：</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsnRBXPX63Pjk-u9pkn_GaBTltF-.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lrTvDdbE86RfGIp3Ke37had8tqP8.m4a" length="33519947" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:22:54</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fs100sdxWi91_dZtlZeRHgQHqT70.png"/>
    <itunes:episode>13</itunes:episode>
