  <item>
    <title>10. 奥运史上最惨烈事件揭秘：慕尼黑惨案（下）</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/66bdefaddb5e6d6bf98d5ec6</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">66bdefaddb5e6d6bf98d5ec6</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 15 Aug 2024 12:08:12 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>慕尼黑恐怖袭击发生三天后，“铁娘子”梅厄夫人带领下的以色列政府马上做出回应：1972年9月8日以色列空军发动三次大型轰炸行动，“巴勒斯坦解放组织”多达十个营地被毁，200多名巴勒斯坦人被炸死。</span></p><span></span><p><span>一个月后“黑九月”组织又劫持了一架德国航班飞机，迫使西德政府释放了三名被捕的恐怖分子。更令以色列全国震怒的是，这三名恐怖分子回到利比亚后成了巴勒斯坦人眼中的英雄。</span></p><span></span><p><span>1972年底，以色列总理梅厄夫人下定决心展开彻底的针对性复仇行动。为此她成立了“X委员会”，以以色列最高情报组织“摩萨德”的负责人兹维·扎米尔为行动负责人。行动代号取名为“上帝之怒”（Operation Wrath of God），目的就是将与慕尼黑恐怖袭击相关的恐怖分子全部暗杀。</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cDovL2ltYWdldjIueG1jZG4uY29tL3N0b3JhZ2VzLzdhMzItYXVkaW9mcmVlaGlnaHFwcy84Ny82MC9HQXJNSm5JS2s3QnZBRDJubndNQWljY2IucG5nIW9wX3R5cGU9NCZkZXZpY2VfdHlwZT1pb3MmdXBsb2FkX3R5cGU9YXR0YWNobWVudCZuYW1lPW1vYmlsZV9sYXJnZQ==.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large"></p><span></span><p><span>1972 年 9 月 7 日，以色列运动员在罗德机场的军用指挥车上的棺材</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cDovL2ltYWdldjIueG1jZG4uY29tL3N0b3JhZ2VzLzdiMzMtYXVkaW9mcmVlaGlnaHFwcy9BMS9FOC9HS3dSSU1BS2s3Qi1BQU9YZHdNQWljeDgucG5nIW9wX3R5cGU9NCZkZXZpY2VfdHlwZT1pb3MmdXBsb2FkX3R5cGU9YXR0YWNobWVudCZuYW1lPW1vYmlsZV9sYXJnZQ==.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large"></p><span></span><p><span>以色列前总理果尔达·梅厄</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cDovL2ltYWdldjIueG1jZG4uY29tL3N0b3JhZ2VzL2MwNjktYXVkaW9mcmVlaGlnaHFwcy82RS9DMy9HQXFocE9vS2s3Q1RBQUdRdWdNQWlkSWQucG5nIW9wX3R5cGU9NCZkZXZpY2VfdHlwZT1pb3MmdXBsb2FkX3R5cGU9YXR0YWNobWVudCZuYW1lPW1vYmlsZV9sYXJnZQ==.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large"></p><span></span><p><span>以色列国防部长摩西·达杨，1941年在战争中失去左眼</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cDovL2ltYWdldjIueG1jZG4uY29tL3N0b3JhZ2VzLzRkNDgtYXVkaW9mcmVlaGlnaHFwcy9CNi9GNS9HQXFoZXhFS2s3Q2hBQVJjRWdNQWlkWm8ucG5nIW9wX3R5cGU9NCZkZXZpY2VfdHlwZT1pb3MmdXBsb2FkX3R5cGU9YXR0YWNobWVudCZuYW1lPW1vYmlsZV9sYXJnZQ==.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large"><span>&nbsp;</span></p><span></span><p><span>摩萨德局长扎米尔</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cDovL2ltYWdldjIueG1jZG4uY29tL3N0b3JhZ2VzL2I0ODItYXVkaW9mcmVlaGlnaHFwcy84Ri9DRi9HQXFoZXhFS2s3Q3NBQW0xaXdNQWlkbTUucG5nIW9wX3R5cGU9NCZkZXZpY2VfdHlwZT1pb3MmdXBsb2FkX3R5cGU9YXR0YWNobWVudCZuYW1lPW1vYmlsZV9sYXJnZQ==.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large"></p><span></span><p><span>被释放后召开“记者会”的三名恐怖分子“英雄”</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cDovL2ltYWdldjIueG1jZG4uY29tL3N0b3JhZ2VzL2Y2ZmQtYXVkaW9mcmVlaGlnaHFwcy80Mi81OC9HQXJNcU9vS2s3QzJBQVZZQWdNQWlkekgucG5nIW9wX3R5cGU9NCZkZXZpY2VfdHlwZT1pb3MmdXBsb2FkX3R5cGU9YXR0YWNobWVudCZuYW1lPW1vYmlsZV9sYXJnZQ==.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large"><span> 报纸登出的以色列复仇名单</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cDovL2ltYWdldjIueG1jZG4uY29tL3N0b3JhZ2VzLzQzMTgtYXVkaW9mcmVlaGlnaHFwcy9DRS9EMi9HQXJNd1kwS2s3REFBQXlBMGdNQWllQ3EucG5nIW9wX3R5cGU9NCZkZXZpY2VfdHlwZT1pb3MmdXBsb2FkX3R5cGU9YXR0YWNobWVudCZuYW1lPW1vYmlsZV9sYXJnZQ==.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large"><span> 后来成为以色列总理的巴拉克</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cDovL2ltYWdldjIueG1jZG4uY29tL3N0b3JhZ2VzL2M2MTUtYXVkaW9mcmVlaGlnaHFwcy9EMS8wMy9HQXFocE9vS2s3RE1BQVRPNUFNQWllVWsucG5nIW9wX3R5cGU9NCZkZXZpY2VfdHlwZT1pb3MmdXBsb2FkX3R5cGU9YXR0YWNobWVudCZuYW1lPW1vYmlsZV9sYXJnZQ==.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large"><span> 阿里•哈桑•萨拉梅，绰号红王子</span></p><span></span><p><img src="https://bts-image.xyzcdn.net/aHR0cDovL2ltYWdldjIueG1jZG4uY29tL3N0b3JhZ2VzL2Y0OWEtYXVkaW9mcmVlaGlnaHFwcy84RS8zQi9HS3dSSVJ3S2s3RFhBQU5UWWdNQWllaksucG5nIW9wX3R5cGU9NCZkZXZpY2VfdHlwZT1pb3MmdXBsb2FkX3R5cGU9YXR0YWNobWVudCZuYW1lPW1vYmlsZV9sYXJnZQ==.png!op_type=4&amp;device_type=ios&amp;upload_type=attachment&amp;name=mobile_large"><span> 唯一善终的黑九月高层领导阿布•达乌德</span></p><span></span><p><span>-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------</span></p><span></span><p><span>参考资料：</span></p><span></span><p><span>网易：《上帝之怒：一场持续20年的复仇》</span></p><span></span><p><span>澎湃：《一桩发生在奥运期间的恐袭惨案，引发了受害国9年的亡命报复》</span></p>]]></description>
